#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Sparse exact-state size-action learner.

The model is deliberately baseline-default:

* train labels from exact cloned portfolio states;
* evaluate only size multipliers;
* choose m != 1.0 only when both a benefit classifier and a conservative
  lower-quantile value model agree that the action has positive edge;
* replay selected actions sequentially through the portfolio engine.
"""

